<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 26.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 26.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tassos N 30,000 long tons maize Durban/Puerto Cabello 3-10/10 $15.50 3,000/3,500 Andre.</p>
<p>Badja 22,000 long tons grains S.Brazil/Yugoslavia 10-20/10 $10.45 5,000/3,000 Agro Grain.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
